<http://data.silknow.org/event/ff8ba635-a756-305e-bb7f-99c693daa435>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Sold from Collection Henry Say, Galerie Georges Petit, Paris, 30 November 1908, lot 32; Château de Fleury-en-Bière; Purchased from Sothebys, London, 1 July 1977, lot 6.\nLot 7, September/Chambord, in a matching border, was purchased by the National Museum of Western Art, Tokyo.\nA third tapestry in this border, December/Monceaux, was acquired by the J Paul Getty Museum in 1985. It is signed I.D.L.CROX . See Bremer-David 1997."@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/9606d97e-fb99-334d-a0c1-75bfd6dfa7a6> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Sold from Collection Henry Say, Galerie Georges Petit, Paris, 30 November 1908, lot 32; Château de Fleury-en-Bière; Purchased from Sothebys, London, 1 July 1977, lot 6.\nLot 7, September/Chambord, in a matching border, was purchased by the National Museum of Western Art, Tokyo.\nA third tapestry in this border, December/Monceaux, was acquired by the J Paul Getty Museum in 1985. It is signed I.D.L.CROX . See Bremer-David 1997."@en .

